[
  {
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 2.16,
    "speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
    "text": "Welcome back to Path Talks.",
    "char_start": 14,
    "char_end": 41,
    "unit_id": "t0000.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0000.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 2.22,
    "end": 7.92,
    "speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
    "text": "Today, we're talking about trail construction, and I'm joined by Stefan Brandt, a trail builder with the Cascadia Alliance.",
    "char_start": 42,
    "char_end": 165,
    "unit_id": "t0000.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0000.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 7.98,
    "end": 10.38,
    "speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
    "text": "Stefan Brandt, thank you for being here.",
    "char_start": 166,
    "char_end": 206,
    "unit_id": "t0000.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0000.s03"
  },
  {
    "start": 10.38,
    "end": 11.22,
    "speaker_label": "Stefan Brandt",
    "text": "Thank you, Katrin.",
    "char_start": 222,
    "char_end": 240,
    "unit_id": "t0001.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0001.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 11.28,
    "end": 15.72,
    "speaker_label": "Stefan Brandt",
    "text": "You're very welcome – road construction is something I've thought a lot about.",
    "char_start": 241,
    "char_end": 319,
    "unit_id": "t0001.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0001.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 15.72,
    "end": 18.12,
    "speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
    "text": "This episode is brought to you by Strava.",
    "char_start": 334,
    "char_end": 375,
    "unit_id": "t0002.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0002.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 18.18,
    "end": 20.28,
    "speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
    "text": "Strava is the home of athletes.",
    "char_start": 376,
    "char_end": 407,
    "unit_id": "t0002.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0002.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 20.34,
    "end": 22.14,
    "speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
    "text": "Visit strava.com/podcast to get started.",
    "char_start": 408,
    "char_end": 448,
    "unit_id": "t0002.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0002.s03"
  },
  {
    "start": 210.0,
    "end": 213.06,
    "speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
    "text": "Tell me about how you made that decision.",
    "char_start": 449,
    "char_end": 490,
    "unit_id": "t0002.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0002.s04"
  },
  {
    "start": 213.12,
    "end": 215.16,
    "speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
    "text": "How does RockShox fit into this picture?",
    "char_start": 491,
    "char_end": 531,
    "unit_id": "t0002.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0002.s05"
  },
  {
    "start": 215.16,
    "end": 221.28,
    "speaker_label": "Stefan Brandt",
    "text": "To be honest, the way you handle drainage is the design decision that has the biggest impact on every project.",
    "char_start": 547,
    "char_end": 657,
    "unit_id": "t0003.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0003.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 221.34,
    "end": 225.24,
    "speaker_label": "Stefan Brandt",
    "text": "We've seen this with teams that use the Cascadia Alliance.",
    "char_start": 658,
    "char_end": 716,
    "unit_id": "t0003.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0003.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 225.3,
    "end": 229.02,
    "speaker_label": "Stefan Brandt",
    "text": "I've observed this pattern in three different teams.",
    "char_start": 717,
    "char_end": 769,
    "unit_id": "t0003.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0003.s03"
  },
  {
    "start": 229.02,
    "end": 232.08,
    "speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
    "text": "Tell me how you made the decision.",
    "char_start": 784,
    "char_end": 818,
    "unit_id": "t0004.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0004.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 232.14,
    "end": 235.68,
    "speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
    "text": "What is the core issue that really matters in this question?",
    "char_start": 819,
    "char_end": 879,
    "unit_id": "t0004.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0004.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 235.68,
    "end": 240.9,
    "speaker_label": "Stefan Brandt",
    "text": "Yes, see – a common mistake that new path builders make is digging with too much of a slope.",
    "char_start": 895,
    "char_end": 987,
    "unit_id": "t0005.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0005.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 240.96,
    "end": 245.88,
    "speaker_label": "Stefan Brandt",
    "text": "Once you understand that, the other decisions become easier.",
    "char_start": 988,
    "char_end": 1048,
    "unit_id": "t0005.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0005.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 245.88,
    "end": 247.38,
    "speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
    "text": "I would like to explore this further.",
    "char_start": 1063,
    "char_end": 1100,
    "unit_id": "t0006.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0006.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 247.44,
    "end": 250.26,
    "speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
    "text": "Where do soil erosion and road construction intersect?",
    "char_start": 1101,
    "char_end": 1155,
    "unit_id": "t0006.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0006.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 250.26,
    "end": 250.56,
    "speaker_label": "Stefan Brandt",
    "text": "Certainly.",
    "char_start": 1171,
    "char_end": 1181,
    "unit_id": "t0007.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0007.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 250.62,
    "end": 255.18,
    "speaker_label": "Stefan Brandt",
    "text": "Discussions about land management must take place before any ground is broken.",
    "char_start": 1182,
    "char_end": 1260,
    "unit_id": "t0007.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0007.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 255.24,
    "end": 258.42,
    "speaker_label": "Stefan Brandt",
    "text": "We've seen this happen with teams that use RockShox products.",
    "char_start": 1261,
    "char_end": 1322,
    "unit_id": "t0007.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0007.s03"
  },
  {
    "start": 258.48,
    "end": 262.38,
    "speaker_label": "Stefan Brandt",
    "text": "The frame is important because it tells you what trade-offs you're making.",
    "char_start": 1323,
    "char_end": 1397,
    "unit_id": "t0007.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0007.s04"
  },
  {
    "start": 262.38,
    "end": 263.88,
    "speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
    "text": "Tell me more about it.",
    "char_start": 1412,
    "char_end": 1434,
    "unit_id": "t0008.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0008.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 263.88,
    "end": 272.94,
    "speaker_label": "Stefan Brandt",
    "text": "And when teams integrate Spoke & Wrench into this process, the trade-offs become clear. If you ignore these trade-offs, you'll end up having to rebuild everything from scratch a year later.",
    "char_start": 1450,
    "char_end": 1639,
    "unit_id": "t0009.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0009.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 272.94,
    "end": 276.0,
    "speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
    "text": "Tell me about how you made the decision.",
    "char_start": 1654,
    "char_end": 1694,
    "unit_id": "t0010.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0010.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 276.06,
    "end": 278.88,
    "speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
    "text": "Where do soil erosion and road construction intersect?",
    "char_start": 1695,
    "char_end": 1749,
    "unit_id": "t0010.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0010.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 278.88,
    "end": 279.18,
    "speaker_label": "Stefan Brandt",
    "text": "Certainly.",
    "char_start": 1765,
    "char_end": 1775,
    "unit_id": "t0011.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0011.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 279.24,
    "end": 281.46,
    "speaker_label": "Stefan Brandt",
    "text": "Bankings on slopes are not optional.",
    "char_start": 1776,
    "char_end": 1812,
    "unit_id": "t0011.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0011.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 281.52,
    "end": 285.18,
    "speaker_label": "Stefan Brandt",
    "text": "The shortcut is the breakthrough in the third year.",
    "char_start": 1813,
    "char_end": 1864,
    "unit_id": "t0011.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0011.s03"
  },
  {
    "start": 285.24,
    "end": 289.38,
    "speaker_label": "Stefan Brandt",
    "text": "And the second-order effect is the part that almost everyone overlooks.",
    "char_start": 1865,
    "char_end": 1936,
    "unit_id": "t0011.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0011.s04"
  },
  {
    "start": 289.38,
    "end": 291.18,
    "speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
    "text": "This is a useful framework.",
    "char_start": 1951,
    "char_end": 1978,
    "unit_id": "t0012.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0012.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 291.24,
    "end": 294.78,
    "speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
    "text": "What is the core issue or the most important aspect of the question?",
    "char_start": 1979,
    "char_end": 2047,
    "unit_id": "t0012.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0012.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 294.78,
    "end": 298.62,
    "speaker_label": "Stefan Brandt",
    "text": "Yes, look – the team structure is more important than people often realize.",
    "char_start": 2063,
    "char_end": 2138,
    "unit_id": "t0013.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0013.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 298.68,
    "end": 302.22,
    "speaker_label": "Stefan Brandt",
    "text": "We've seen this with teams that use the Spoke & Wrench model.",
    "char_start": 2139,
    "char_end": 2200,
    "unit_id": "t0013.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0013.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 302.28,
    "end": 306.0,
    "speaker_label": "Stefan Brandt",
    "text": "I've observed this pattern in three different teams.",
    "char_start": 2201,
    "char_end": 2253,
    "unit_id": "t0013.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0013.s03"
  },
  {
    "start": 306.0,
    "end": 307.8,
    "speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
    "text": "What does the error mode look like?",
    "char_start": 2268,
    "char_end": 2303,
    "unit_id": "t0014.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0014.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 307.86,
    "end": 312.84,
    "speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
    "text": "What is the structural perspective that most listeners do not have access to?",
    "char_start": 2304,
    "char_end": 2381,
    "unit_id": "t0014.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0014.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 312.84,
    "end": 316.44,
    "speaker_label": "Stefan Brandt",
    "text": "Let me share with you the perspective that I truly believe in.",
    "char_start": 2397,
    "char_end": 2459,
    "unit_id": "t0015.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0015.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 316.5,
    "end": 321.6,
    "speaker_label": "Stefan Brandt",
    "text": "I have changed my opinion about machine-built versus hand-built trails.",
    "char_start": 2460,
    "char_end": 2531,
    "unit_id": "t0015.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0015.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 321.66,
    "end": 325.38,
    "speaker_label": "Stefan Brandt",
    "text": "I have observed this pattern in three different teams.",
    "char_start": 2532,
    "char_end": 2586,
    "unit_id": "t0015.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0015.s03"
  },
  {
    "start": 325.38,
    "end": 326.88,
    "speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
    "text": "Tell me more about it.",
    "char_start": 2601,
    "char_end": 2623,
    "unit_id": "t0016.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0016.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 326.88,
    "end": 336.3,
    "speaker_label": "Stefan Brandt",
    "text": "And when teams integrate the Cascadia Alliance into this process, the trade-offs become clear. If you ignore these trade-offs, you'll end up having to rebuild everything from scratch a year later.",
    "char_start": 2639,
    "char_end": 2835,
    "unit_id": "t0017.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0017.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 336.3,
    "end": 339.48,
    "speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
    "text": "We'll be right back after a short commercial break.",
    "char_start": 2850,
    "char_end": 2901,
    "unit_id": "t0018.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0018.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 720.0,
    "end": 722.76,
    "speaker_label": "SPEAKER_02",
    "text": "Today's episode is brought to you by Stripe.",
    "char_start": 2914,
    "char_end": 2958,
    "unit_id": "t0019.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0019.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 722.82,
    "end": 728.04,
    "speaker_label": "SPEAKER_02",
    "text": "Stripe makes payments easy, whether you're running a marketplace or a subscription business.",
    "char_start": 2959,
    "char_end": 3051,
    "unit_id": "t0019.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0019.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 728.1,
    "end": 731.52,
    "speaker_label": "SPEAKER_02",
    "text": "Visit stripe.com/podcast for a free trial.",
    "char_start": 3052,
    "char_end": 3094,
    "unit_id": "t0019.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0019.s03"
  },
  {
    "start": 840.0,
    "end": 841.98,
    "speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
    "text": "Welcome back to the show.",
    "char_start": 3109,
    "char_end": 3134,
    "unit_id": "t0020.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0020.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 842.04,
    "end": 843.84,
    "speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
    "text": "What does the error mode look like?",
    "char_start": 3135,
    "char_end": 3170,
    "unit_id": "t0020.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0020.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 843.9,
    "end": 846.72,
    "speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
    "text": "Where do soil erosion and road construction intersect?",
    "char_start": 3171,
    "char_end": 3225,
    "unit_id": "t0020.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0020.s03"
  },
  {
    "start": 846.72,
    "end": 847.68,
    "speaker_label": "Stefan Brandt",
    "text": "That's my perspective.",
    "char_start": 3241,
    "char_end": 3263,
    "unit_id": "t0021.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0021.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 847.74,
    "end": 852.96,
    "speaker_label": "Stefan Brandt",
    "text": "Drainage is the design decision that has the biggest impact on performance, regardless of the route.",
    "char_start": 3264,
    "char_end": 3364,
    "unit_id": "t0021.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0021.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 853.02,
    "end": 856.14,
    "speaker_label": "Stefan Brandt",
    "text": "We've seen this with teams that use Shimano components.",
    "char_start": 3365,
    "char_end": 3420,
    "unit_id": "t0021.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0021.s03"
  },
  {
    "start": 856.2,
    "end": 860.04,
    "speaker_label": "Stefan Brandt",
    "text": "If you ignore that, you'll have to rebuild everything from scratch a year later.",
    "char_start": 3421,
    "char_end": 3501,
    "unit_id": "t0021.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0021.s04"
  },
  {
    "start": 860.04,
    "end": 863.1,
    "speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
    "text": "Tell me about how you made the decision.",
    "char_start": 3516,
    "char_end": 3556,
    "unit_id": "t0022.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0022.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 863.16,
    "end": 865.2,
    "speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
    "text": "How does RockShox fit into this picture?",
    "char_start": 3557,
    "char_end": 3597,
    "unit_id": "t0022.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0022.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 865.2,
    "end": 870.42,
    "speaker_label": "Stefan Brandt",
    "text": "Yes, see – a common mistake that new path builders make is digging with too much of a slope.",
    "char_start": 3613,
    "char_end": 3705,
    "unit_id": "t0023.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0023.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 870.48,
    "end": 875.4,
    "speaker_label": "Stefan Brandt",
    "text": "Once you understand that, the other decisions become easier.",
    "char_start": 3706,
    "char_end": 3766,
    "unit_id": "t0023.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0023.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 875.4,
    "end": 877.98,
    "speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
    "text": "Challenge my existing beliefs.",
    "char_start": 3781,
    "char_end": 3811,
    "unit_id": "t0024.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0024.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 878.04,
    "end": 881.7,
    "speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
    "text": "What did you used to believe about this, and how have your views changed since then?",
    "char_start": 3812,
    "char_end": 3896,
    "unit_id": "t0024.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0024.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 881.7,
    "end": 885.3,
    "speaker_label": "Stefan Brandt",
    "text": "Let me share with you the approach that I truly believe in.",
    "char_start": 3912,
    "char_end": 3971,
    "unit_id": "t0025.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0025.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 885.36,
    "end": 889.92,
    "speaker_label": "Stefan Brandt",
    "text": "Discussions about land management must take place before any digging begins.",
    "char_start": 3972,
    "char_end": 4048,
    "unit_id": "t0025.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0025.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 889.98,
    "end": 893.52,
    "speaker_label": "Stefan Brandt",
    "text": "We've seen this with teams that use Spoke & Wrench.",
    "char_start": 4049,
    "char_end": 4100,
    "unit_id": "t0025.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0025.s03"
  },
  {
    "start": 893.58,
    "end": 897.3,
    "speaker_label": "Stefan Brandt",
    "text": "I've observed this pattern in three different teams.",
    "char_start": 4101,
    "char_end": 4153,
    "unit_id": "t0025.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0025.s04"
  },
  {
    "start": 897.3,
    "end": 898.8,
    "speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
    "text": "That fits.\nThat works.\nThat's perfect.\nThat's right.\nThat's a good fit.",
    "char_start": 4168,
    "char_end": 4239,
    "unit_id": "t0026.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0026.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 898.8,
    "end": 904.86,
    "speaker_label": "Stefan Brandt",
    "text": "Outside of the tools available at the Cascadia Alliance level, the error mode is more difficult to identify.",
    "char_start": 4255,
    "char_end": 4363,
    "unit_id": "t0027.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0027.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 904.92,
    "end": 909.06,
    "speaker_label": "Stefan Brandt",
    "text": "And the second-order effect is the part that almost everyone overlooks.",
    "char_start": 4364,
    "char_end": 4435,
    "unit_id": "t0027.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0027.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 909.06,
    "end": 912.24,
    "speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
    "text": "What is the guiding principle you always come back to?",
    "char_start": 4450,
    "char_end": 4504,
    "unit_id": "t0028.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0028.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 912.3,
    "end": 915.84,
    "speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
    "text": "What is the core of the question that really matters?",
    "char_start": 4505,
    "char_end": 4558,
    "unit_id": "t0028.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0028.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 915.84,
    "end": 919.92,
    "speaker_label": "Stefan Brandt",
    "text": "It all boils down to this: curbs on slopes are not optional.",
    "char_start": 4574,
    "char_end": 4634,
    "unit_id": "t0029.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0029.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 919.98,
    "end": 923.64,
    "speaker_label": "Stefan Brandt",
    "text": "The shortcut is the breakthrough in the third year.",
    "char_start": 4635,
    "char_end": 4686,
    "unit_id": "t0029.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0029.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 923.7,
    "end": 927.42,
    "speaker_label": "Stefan Brandt",
    "text": "I have observed this pattern in three different teams.",
    "char_start": 4687,
    "char_end": 4741,
    "unit_id": "t0029.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0029.s03"
  },
  {
    "start": 1320.0,
    "end": 1321.8,
    "speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
    "text": "What does the failure mode look like?",
    "char_start": 4756,
    "char_end": 4793,
    "unit_id": "t0030.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0030.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 1321.86,
    "end": 1325.28,
    "speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
    "text": "What is the most underestimated aspect of road construction?",
    "char_start": 4794,
    "char_end": 4854,
    "unit_id": "t0030.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0030.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 1325.28,
    "end": 1328.88,
    "speaker_label": "Stefan Brandt",
    "text": "Let me share with you the framework that I truly believe in.",
    "char_start": 4870,
    "char_end": 4930,
    "unit_id": "t0031.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0031.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 1328.94,
    "end": 1332.06,
    "speaker_label": "Stefan Brandt",
    "text": "The underlying structure is more important than people often realize.",
    "char_start": 4931,
    "char_end": 5000,
    "unit_id": "t0031.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0031.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 1332.12,
    "end": 1336.02,
    "speaker_label": "Stefan Brandt",
    "text": "We've seen this with teams that utilize the Cascadia Alliance.",
    "char_start": 5001,
    "char_end": 5063,
    "unit_id": "t0031.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0031.s03"
  },
  {
    "start": 1336.08,
    "end": 1339.8,
    "speaker_label": "Stefan Brandt",
    "text": "I've observed this pattern in three different teams.",
    "char_start": 5064,
    "char_end": 5116,
    "unit_id": "t0031.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0031.s04"
  },
  {
    "start": 1339.8,
    "end": 1341.3,
    "speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
    "text": "I would like to explore this further.",
    "char_start": 5131,
    "char_end": 5168,
    "unit_id": "t0032.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0032.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 1341.36,
    "end": 1343.34,
    "speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
    "text": "How does Shimano fit into this picture?",
    "char_start": 5169,
    "char_end": 5208,
    "unit_id": "t0032.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0032.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 1343.34,
    "end": 1349.16,
    "speaker_label": "Stefan Brandt",
    "text": "Yes, look – I've changed my opinion about machine-built versus hand-built roads.",
    "char_start": 5224,
    "char_end": 5304,
    "unit_id": "t0033.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0033.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 1349.22,
    "end": 1354.14,
    "speaker_label": "Stefan Brandt",
    "text": "Once you understand that, the other decisions become easier.",
    "char_start": 5305,
    "char_end": 5365,
    "unit_id": "t0033.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0033.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 1354.14,
    "end": 1356.12,
    "speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
    "text": "Where does it stop working?",
    "char_start": 5380,
    "char_end": 5407,
    "unit_id": "t0034.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0034.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 1356.12,
    "end": 1361.7,
    "speaker_label": "Stefan Brandt",
    "text": "Outside of the tools available at the RockShox level, the error mode is more difficult to identify.",
    "char_start": 5423,
    "char_end": 5522,
    "unit_id": "t0035.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0035.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 1361.76,
    "end": 1366.68,
    "speaker_label": "Stefan Brandt",
    "text": "Once you understand that, the remaining decisions become easier.",
    "char_start": 5523,
    "char_end": 5587,
    "unit_id": "t0035.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0035.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 1366.68,
    "end": 1371.48,
    "speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
    "text": "Let's change the subject – I would like to dedicate the next section to land management.",
    "char_start": 5602,
    "char_end": 5690,
    "unit_id": "t0036.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0036.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 1371.48,
    "end": 1378.68,
    "speaker_label": "Stefan Brandt",
    "text": "That's where the conversation becomes interesting, because the considerations surrounding land management permeate everything we've discussed.",
    "char_start": 5706,
    "char_end": 5848,
    "unit_id": "t0037.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0037.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 1378.68,
    "end": 1380.18,
    "speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
    "text": "I would like to explore this further.",
    "char_start": 5863,
    "char_end": 5900,
    "unit_id": "t0038.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0038.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 1380.24,
    "end": 1384.74,
    "speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
    "text": "What is the opposing perspective that most listeners are unable to grasp?",
    "char_start": 5901,
    "char_end": 5974,
    "unit_id": "t0038.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0038.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 1384.74,
    "end": 1391.82,
    "speaker_label": "Stefan Brandt",
    "text": "Ultimately, the suspension setup is the design choice that has the biggest impact on performance, regardless of the riding style.",
    "char_start": 5990,
    "char_end": 6119,
    "unit_id": "t0039.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0039.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 1391.88,
    "end": 1395.06,
    "speaker_label": "Stefan Brandt",
    "text": "We've seen this with teams that use RockShox.",
    "char_start": 6120,
    "char_end": 6165,
    "unit_id": "t0039.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0039.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 1395.12,
    "end": 1398.96,
    "speaker_label": "Stefan Brandt",
    "text": "If you ignore this, you'll end up having to rebuild everything from scratch a year later.",
    "char_start": 6166,
    "char_end": 6255,
    "unit_id": "t0039.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0039.s03"
  },
  {
    "start": 1398.96,
    "end": 1400.76,
    "speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
    "text": "What does the failure mode look like?",
    "char_start": 6270,
    "char_end": 6307,
    "unit_id": "t0040.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0040.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 1400.82,
    "end": 1404.24,
    "speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
    "text": "What is the most underestimated aspect of road construction?",
    "char_start": 6308,
    "char_end": 6368,
    "unit_id": "t0040.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0040.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 1404.24,
    "end": 1409.64,
    "speaker_label": "Stefan Brandt",
    "text": "To be honest, the most common mistake made by new path builders is digging with too much of a slope.",
    "char_start": 6384,
    "char_end": 6484,
    "unit_id": "t0041.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0041.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 1409.7,
    "end": 1413.6,
    "speaker_label": "Stefan Brandt",
    "text": "The framework is important because it tells you what considerations you are taking into account.",
    "char_start": 6485,
    "char_end": 6581,
    "unit_id": "t0041.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0041.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 1680.0,
    "end": 1685.22,
    "speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
    "text": "Before we wrap up, what's one thing that listeners can try out this week?",
    "char_start": 6596,
    "char_end": 6669,
    "unit_id": "t0042.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0042.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 1685.22,
    "end": 1690.02,
    "speaker_label": "Stefan Brandt",
    "text": "Choose one of the ideas we discussed and implement it for two weeks.",
    "char_start": 6685,
    "char_end": 6753,
    "unit_id": "t0043.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0043.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 1690.08,
    "end": 1691.46,
    "speaker_label": "Stefan Brandt",
    "text": "The rest is iteration.",
    "char_start": 6754,
    "char_end": 6776,
    "unit_id": "t0043.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0043.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 1691.46,
    "end": 1695.48,
    "speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
    "text": "And finally, a big thank you to our partners at Linear.",
    "char_start": 6791,
    "char_end": 6846,
    "unit_id": "t0044.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0044.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 1695.54,
    "end": 1700.58,
    "speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
    "text": "Linear is the issue tracker, built for speed – designed for keyboard use.",
    "char_start": 6847,
    "char_end": 6920,
    "unit_id": "t0044.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0044.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 1700.64,
    "end": 1702.32,
    "speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
    "text": "Visit linear.com.",
    "char_start": 6921,
    "char_end": 6938,
    "unit_id": "t0044.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0044.s03"
  },
  {
    "start": 1702.32,
    "end": 1704.6,
    "speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
    "text": "Stefan Brandt, thank you for the conversation.",
    "char_start": 6939,
    "char_end": 6985,
    "unit_id": "t0044.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0044.s04"
  },
  {
    "start": 1704.6,
    "end": 1706.1,
    "speaker_label": "Stefan Brandt",
    "text": "Thank you, Katrin.",
    "char_start": 7001,
    "char_end": 7019,
    "unit_id": "t0045.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0045.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 1706.1,
    "end": 1709.16,
    "speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
    "text": "That's all for today's episode of \"Path Conversations.\"",
    "char_start": 7034,
    "char_end": 7089,
    "unit_id": "t0046.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0046.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 1709.22,
    "end": 1710.48,
    "speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
    "text": "Until next time.",
    "char_start": 7090,
    "char_end": 7106,
    "unit_id": "t0046.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0046.s02"
  }
]
